La Peiza is a town operated by the [[Org/Althane/Red Dragon Rail Company|Red Dragon Rail Company]], built around an ancient well. The town recently suffered a great drought as the water from the well was tainted with some magical ailment. [[Org/Althane/The Weft|The Weft]] descended to the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/La Peiza/Hadal Tap|Hadal Tap]] within the well and cleared the problem, saving the town.
